00:02:20,100 --> 00:02:22,000
静かな午後 淡い日差し
Quiet afternoon, pale sunlightfiltering through...

3
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:25,000
カーテンが揺れる キミの声
The swaying curtains, your voice...

4
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:28,000
近づく足音だけで分かる
I know it just by your approaching footsteps.

5
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:30,000
さあ 今日はどんな味が良い？
Now, what flavor do you want today?

6
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:33,700
囁く悪魔の誘惑 what do you want?
The whispering devil's temptation, what do you want?

7
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:36,500
Ah.. sickbayで待ち合わせ mistakeなヨカン
Ah, a rendezvous in the sickbay, a mistaken yokan.

8
00:02:36,500 --> 00:02:39,000
扉開けてさあこっちへおいで
Open the door, come on over here!

9
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:42,500
教科書に載っていないこの気持ちは何ですか？
What is this feeling not found in any textbook?

10
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:45,000
可愛い可愛い顔みせて
Show me your cute, cute face.

11
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:48,000
sickbayで会いましょう mistakeしちゃう？
Let's meet in the sickbay, want to make a mistake?

12
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:51,500
永遠に続け 時間よ止まって
May this last forever, time, please stop.

13
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:55,500
教室じゃみせられない 笑顔の秘密は
The secret to a smile you can't show in the classroom...

14
00:02:55,500 --> 00:03:00,000
甘い甘いお菓子あげる 囁く悪魔の誘惑 い・か・が？
Is giving you sweet, sweet sweets, the whispering devil's temptation... Is it this, that, or what?

15
00:03:00,500 --> 00:03:04,000
秒針のリズム追い越してく
Chasing past the rhythm of the second hand,

16
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:07,500
聴かせてもっとキミの鼓動
Let me hear your heartbeat even more.

17
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:11,000
触れる視線で身体中騒ぐの
Gazing with touching eyes makes my whole body throb,

18
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:15,000
もうどうしようもないくらい
To the point where nothing else matters anymore—

19
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:18,500
禁断の果実 甘い もう後に戻れない
Forbidden fruit, sweet, there's no going back.

20
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:22,000
目が合って はにかんで 触れ合って
Our eyes meet, we smile, we touch,

21
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:25,500
見つめ合って 永遠の楽園に誘う
We gaze at each other, invited to an eternal paradise.

22
00:03:25,500 --> 00:03:29,000
愛の言葉を耳元で囁いてあげる
Whispering words of love right by your ear,

23
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:32,000
sickbayで待ってるわ mistakeな時間
Waiting for you in the sickbay, a mistaken time.

24
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:35,000
扉閉めてもっと近づいて
Even if you close the door, get closer.

25
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:39,000
神様も止められない この気持ちの正体を
Not even God can stop the true nature of this feeling—

26
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:42,000
知らないふりはもうできない
I can't pretend I don't know anymore.

27
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:45,000
sickbayで会いたいのに mistakeしましょう
I want to meet you in the sickbay, let's make a mistake.

28
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:49,000
永遠はここにあるって信じて
Believe that eternity is right here.

29
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:52,500
キミにしかみせない 笑顔の裏側
The other side of the smile I can only show you—

30
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:57,000
甘い甘い果実あげる 囁く悪魔の誘惑 もっといかが？
Giving you sweet, sweet fruit, the whispering devil's temptation... How about a little more?

31
00:03:57,000 --> 00:04:00,000
いつでもここで待ってる my cute student
Waiting for you here anytime, my cute student.

32
